#
# Conformance case: teleology/plan-instantiation-witness.
#
# A two-step serial plan (a logic:SerialConjunction program root — the plan the run
# executes under) runs from the start state. Each executed occurrence is materialized as a
# logic:TransactionStep carrying BOTH logic:instantiatesSchema (the reusable ActionSchema
# it instantiates — Event to Schema) and logic:instantiatesPlan (the whole logic:Plan it
# was executed under — Event to Plan). The pair is the in-band recovery witness the
# correspondence put-leg needs to recover the planned skeleton from an execution record
# (the openEHR Instruction to Activity to Action ISM linkage made canonical).
#
# CRITICAL: the teleology evaluator seeds ONLY from input.nq world facts; this
# input.logic.ttl carries the minimal, clean-compiling, certifiable program axiom the
# projections need (no asserted teleology triples here — the world facts live in input.nq).

@prefix logic: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/> .
@prefix ex:    <https://example.org/teleology/plan-instantiation-witness/> .

ex:GoalExpression a logic:GoalExpression .
